title: Duty Free
text: Everything that crosses the border pays a tariff. The buyer at the far gate ordered yellow, and the only thing you have to collect it with is a prism.
trick: hit from behind, a prism swallows the blue and throws red and green to opposite sides of the beam instead of fanning them; turned the usual way its blue runs straight on to the yellow target. Red and green go round either side and meet at the gate
motif: pictogram (two walls: a thick border with one gate, an outer wall with the buyer in its gate; theme: a tariff as a toll on a beam)
expect: recolours>=1
---
